</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00296/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一台X射线安检设备，有10%的概率会将放入其中的行李箱/包之间的行李进行交换。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/5/23<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>上海市[已编辑]地铁站的安检入口<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被存放在Site-CN-33的异常物品收容单元中<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>你能想象当你打开你的行李箱时，发现里面的各种文件全他妈变成了化妆品和bra的感受吗？！——愤怒的Bruce博士</em></p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00296" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00296" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00296-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/brucewu0463" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5526785); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5526785&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609903402" alt="BruceWu0463" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5526785)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/brucewu0463" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5526785); return false;">BruceWu0463</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1593845195 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">04 Jul 2020 06:46</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00164/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>项目样式为一个陶制烫酒壶，当向项目内注入液体并用热水加热时，项目内的液体将会转化成一种星空色未知鸡尾酒类液体，并在温度达到温热后散发出柔和光芒，喝下后据Dr.Stevenson说极为美味，且每次转换出来的星空色液体味道都不同，对身体无异常影响。（该项目已被证明不可损坏）<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Dr.Freezingheart收到的礼物中。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>Dr.Freezingheart私人物品。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>太棒了，谁送的，我很喜欢！嘿！赵博士，不来喝一杯吗？——Dr.Freezingheart<br />
来！满上！——Dr.赵</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+附录</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;点我隐藏</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>[赵博士的喝酒方式貌似不太适合喝鸡尾酒，他适合去喝二锅头。——Dr.Stevenson]</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">作者的话</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;点我隐藏</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>[[如果有更好的整改意见请私信我呦~]]</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00164" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00164" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00164-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/freezingheart" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6401769); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6401769&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609903403" alt="Freezingheart" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6401769)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/freezingheart" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6401769); return false;">Freezingheart</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1588840447 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">07 May 2020 08:34</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00389/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一辆严重损毁的2008款丰田RAV4<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-135573-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnote-135573-1')">1</a></sup>，任何进入该车驾驶舱内部的人类个体均会产生自身正在经历高速翻滚的错觉，且所有进入其内部的人类个体在离开该项目后均被检测出不同程度的脑震荡。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/8/31<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>杭州市一废车场<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>已被拆毁，残骸经确认无异常性质<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>可以想到这辆车出事前经历了什么</em>——Dr.Jackson</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00389" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00389" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00389-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/miku1314" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4546338); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4546338&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609903403" alt="miku1314" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4546338)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/miku1314" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4546338); return false;">miku1314</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1599314532 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">05 Sep 2020 14:02</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
<div class="footnotes-footer">
<div class="title">脚注</div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-135573-1"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-135573-1')">1</a>. 经确认，该车曾在杭州██山道发生过一次重大事故，此次事故直接导致其原车主当场死亡</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00224/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一张铁架床，当有人躺在项目上并且闭上眼睛时，此人将持续听见“嗡嗡”声当对象睁眼时异常性质消失<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Dr.pigeon的卧室中<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>放置于低价值异常物品收容室<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>哪里有蚊子啊啊啊啊！搞得我一宿没睡觉啊啊啊啊！</em>——在卧室中喷了一整瓶花露水的Dr.pigeon</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00224" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00224" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00224-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpionidaslaughter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6306406); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6306406&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609903403" alt="ScorpionidaSlaughter" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6306406)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpionidaslaughter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6306406); return false;">ScorpionidaSlaughter</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1590860663 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">30 May 2020 17:44</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00106/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一个200ml规格试剂瓶，内装有100ml██%浓度的BaCl2溶液。若内容物被倒出，项目将在10s～3min后填满自身。(填满时间视内容物倒出量多少而定)当有人员目视到项目并目光停留2s以上时会出现一种极强的饮用项目内的液体的冲动。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/04/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site-CN-██下属█号化学实验室<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>保存于Site-CN-██低危异常物品储存库。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>在Site-CN-██医疗部报告急性钡中毒事件异常增多后于特工████·綝的突发氯化钡中毒事件中被发现。</em></p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00106" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00106" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00106-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/harbingerlin" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2680404); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2680404&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609903403" alt="HarbingerLin" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2680404)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/harbingerlin" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2680404); return false;">HarbingerLin</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1587789788 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">25 Apr 2020 04:43</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
    
